# Your Customers are Disappearing

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/high-churn-rate/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

It's common knowledge: keeping an old customer is way cheaper than hunting for a new one. If people are buying once and then vanishing, your business is essentially a leaky bucket. Most people leave because they feel ignored or just forget you exist. We help you fix that with "Lifecycle Marketing" that stays in touch without being annoying.